{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3306f1fee3c86317","name":"Interlocking Hilt","source":{"id":"source:reference-3306f1fee3c86317","title":"Interlocking Hilt","revision":20453,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:52:37Z","sha256":"26fdc26fe87e204106b88586da2757aa8f8830108ac044ca7ef78e04ce2e3ef0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20453","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Interlocking%20Hilt&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3306f1fee3c86317","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," accessory is usually applied to a pair of standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," and intended for users who prefer to wield two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," simultaneously. The creator of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," grafts a small, interlocking mechanism to the base of each ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},". As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", the hilts of the two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," can be locked together, turning the weapon into a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Weapon"}," (considered to be one size category larger than the largest of the two weapons).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
